    "ExtractionConf": {
      "description": "One declared variable: where to read it, and what to do with what is read.\n\n`location` says where to read -- \"metadata\" or \"variable\" -- and nothing\nabout what the value means. `mapping` says what the value read means:\n\n    \"raw\"             the value read IS the answer. The default, and what\n                      every conf written before this field existed means.\n    \"ad_table_lookup\" the value read is an opaque token; the answer is a\n                      stratum variable off the frozen ad_attributions row\n                      that token identifies.\n\n`key` and `name` are both contextual to the mapping, which is the one\ngenuinely confusing part of this:\n\n    key   WHERE TO READ. For \"raw\" it addresses the value; for a lookup it\n          addresses the token. Never hardcoded -- fly stamps the token at\n          metadata.vt by convention and the conf says location \"metadata\",\n          key \"vt\" to match. A respondent recruited by a web or app\n          destination brings the token back as a survey field instead, so\n          a lookup reads from either location.\n    name  the output variable name and, for a lookup, ALSO the key into the\n          frozen row (which stratum variable to pull). It does double duty\n          because you name the output after the stratum variable anyway.",
      "properties": {
        "aggregate": {
          "title": "Aggregate",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "functions": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractionFunctionConf"
          },
          "title": "Functions",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "key": {
          "title": "Key",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "location": {
          "title": "Location",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "mapping": {
          "default": "raw",
          "title": "Mapping",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "value_type": {
          "title": "Value Type",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "location",
        "key",
        "name",
        "functions",
        "value_type",
        "aggregate"
      ],
      "title": "ExtractionConf",
      "type": "object"
    },
